{"slug":"dutch-ruppersberger","qid":"Q981559","name":"Dutch Ruppersberger","desc":"American politician","article":"Dutch Ruppersberger","born":"1946-01-31","died":null,"birthplace":"Baltimore","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"MD-02","f":2003,"u":2025}],"summary":"Charles Albert \"Dutch\" Ruppersberger III ( ROO-pərss-bur-gər; born January 31, 1946) is an American lawyer and politician who served as the U.S. representative for Maryland's 2nd congressional district from 2003 to 2025. A member of the Democratic Party, he served as an assistant state attorney of Maryland from 1972 to 1980, a Baltimore County councilman from 1985 to 1994, and Baltimore County Executive from 1994 until 2002. He was the ranking member of the United States House Permanent Select Committee on Intelligence from 2011 to 2015.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":158998,"s":59.23,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":224836,"s":67.72,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":167201,"s":66.01,"w":true,"n":"Ca Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":192183,"s":62.1,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":120412,"s":61.32,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":194088,"s":65.58,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":134133,"s":64.21,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":198578,"s":71.86,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":135818,"s":69.21,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":164751,"s":66.68,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"MD-02","p":"D","v":105718,"s":54.31,"w":true,"n":"C A Dutch Ruppersberger"}]}